# Cycle 19, step a2: Classic 2p, Four Crowns 1v1, Classic 6p. League settings (docs/game-settings.md) with four card/capitals/blizzard variants; Jacob Sensei
# teaches and fills about half the seats; delove@13 / delove@12 the rest; the branch seat moves round the table.
c2a 1200 delove-branch@1:range:gumbel,jacob-sensei@1 {"autoSetup":true,"balancedBlitz":true,"chooseCapitals":true,"cardValues":"progressive"}
